<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">PASS YOUR BOOK FORWARD</view><view class="heading">{{editId?'修改教材':'让教材遇见下一位用户'}}</view><view class="sub">仅支持学习教材，审核通过后上架。</view><view wx:if="!verified" class="card"><view class="note">请先完成用户认证，再发布教材。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="verify">去认证</button></view><view class="card"><view class="label">教材正反面照片</view><view class="photos"><view class="image-upload" data-side="front" bindtap="image"><image wx:if="front" src="{{front.preview}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text wx:else>＋ 正面实拍</text></view><view class="image-upload" data-side="back" bindtap="image"><image wx:if="back" src="{{back.preview}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text wx:else>＋ 反面实拍</text></view></view><view class="label">教材名称</view><input class="input" value="{{title}}" placeholder="包含书名、版本或册次" maxlength="100" data-field="title" bindinput="input"/><view class="label">适用主题</view><picker range="{{topics}}" range-key="name" value="{{topicIndex}}" data-field="topicIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{topicIndex>0?topics[topicIndex].name:'请选择主题'}}</view></picker><view class="label">适用分类</view><picker range="{{categories}}" range-key="name" value="{{categoryIndex}}" data-field="categoryIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{categoryIndex>0?categories[categoryIndex].name:'跨分类教材可选「通用」'}}</view></picker><view class="label">所在交付区域</view><picker range="{{locations}}" range-key="name" value="{{locationIndex}}" data-field="locationIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{locationIndex>0?locations[locationIndex].name:'请选择交付区域'}}</view></picker><view class="label">售价 元</view><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{price}}" placeholder="例如 18.00" data-field="price" bindinput="input"/><view class="note">试运营平台手续费 0 元，预计结算 ¥{{price||'0.00'}}。结算以订单和渠道实际记录为准。</view><view class="label">成色与笔记情况</view><textarea class="input textarea" value="{{condition}}" placeholder="描述磨损、笔记、缺页等情况" maxlength="300" data-field="condition" bindinput="input"/><view class="label">交付说明</view><textarea class="input textarea" value="{{handoff}}" placeholder="说明交付地点、时间和可提供的交付方式" maxlength="300" data-field="handoff" bindinput="input"/><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{!verified||busy}}" bindtap="submit">提交审核</button></view></view>
